{"chunk_pass": {"key": "5c7f5859181a6292", "candidates": [{"type": "decisions", "text": "Proposed design direction: use wood for the remote control case.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.51", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.12", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.73", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.74"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Unclear meaning of 'advanced chip on print' (whether it is micro-processor based) and a plan to clarify by next meeting.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.29", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.30", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.78", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.79", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.11", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.17", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.31", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.80", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.32", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.33", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.34", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.81", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.82", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.83"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Use only hard or extremely hard wood for the remote.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.24", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.28", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.25"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Include a battery-life indicator light that dims as the battery dies.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.62"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Incorporate a flip-screen feature on the remote to avoid accidental presses or damage when sat on.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.58", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.60"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Make the remote customizable to hand size by offering different widths for larger hands.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.55", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.114", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.115"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Provide options for wood type and color to allow personalized wood choices.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.32", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.101"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Include audio and tactile feedback on button presses and provide a way to turn off voice control.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.63", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.117", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.75"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Risk of splinters when using wood; user hand discomfort or injury if the wood finish is not handled properly.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.110"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Battery life concerns: batteries may die during use and there is a need for a visible indicator of remaining power.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.61", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.62"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Concern about long-term durability claims for wood remote, including the idea that it could last for hundreds of years.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.88", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.89"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The cost of the product is identified as a likely obstacle.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.56"], "owner_ids": ["MIE085"], "owner_cue": "Problem is obviously gonna be cost.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is concern that competitors are copying or stealing the product concept.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.65", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.66", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.67"], "owner_ids": ["MIE085"], "owner_cue": "They're stealing our product.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The group has reached an agreement to pursue a wooden, customizable case for the device.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.182", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.123", "IS1008c.B.dialog-act.s9553330.138"], "owner_ids": ["FIE073"], "owner_cue": "ID(FIE073): I think we've kinda come to some agreement regarding um this concept of a wooden case.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The buttons will be rubber like they are now, not wood, to preserve the tactile experience.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.95", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.186"], "owner_ids": ["MIO086"], "owner_cue": "PM(MIO086): I think they could be rubber like they are now", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will stick with the simple design for the time being until the cost of adding the display is known.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.100", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.101"], "owner_ids": ["MIO086"], "owner_cue": "PM(MIO086): what we'll do is, uh, we will stick with the the simple design for time being until Ed finds out how much it costs to add the display", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will not build our own fabric factory; we will tie up with a fabric supplier to cut costs.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.83", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.84", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.85"], "owner_ids": ["MIO086"], "owner_cue": "PM(MIO086): So we don't need to have our own uh fabric factory or something", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Need to learn about labour laws in different countries to ensure fair wages and avoid exploitation in manufacturing.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.153", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.69", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.154", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.155", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.70", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.156"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "ID(FIE073): we might wanna um learn about um labour laws", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The cost of adding a display is not known and needs to be researched.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.173", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.116", "IS1008c.D.dialog-act.s9553330.117", "IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.174"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "ID(FIE073): Do you wanna take an action item to go find out?", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "ambiguous", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The group will stick with the simple design for the time being.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.100"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The buttons will be rubber like they are now.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.C.dialog-act.s9553330.186", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.96", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.97"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Uncertainty about the additional cost of the display and whether to add a display.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.101", "IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.114"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}]}, "action_pass": {"key": "db6d0a6b874ebd39", "samples": [[{"type": "actions", "text": "The presenters (FIE038 and FIE073) will come up with the prototype design for the remote control and show how it looks by the next meeting.", "evidence_da_ids": ["IS1008c.A.dialog-act.s9553330.122"], "owner_ids": ["FIE038", "FIE073"], "owner_cue": "by next meeting, please come up with the prototype", "deadline_cue": "by next meeting", "owner_basis": "inferred", "deadline": "by next